  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="01:01.640" end="01:05.330" ttm:agent="v1">You think the rules don't apply to the golden boy?</p>
      <p begin="01:05.330" end="01:07.880" ttm:agent="v1">Brilliance makes up for a lot</p>
      <p begin="01:07.880" end="01:12.350" ttm:agent="v1">Don't alienate the only people in the world that understand</p>
      <p begin="01:12.350" end="01:15.950" ttm:agent="v1">You think the rules don't apply to the golden boy?</p>
      <p begin="01:15.950" end="01:18.680" ttm:agent="v1">Brilliance makes up for a lot</p>
      <p begin="01:18.680" end="01:21.760" ttm:agent="v1">Don't alienate the only people in the world that understand</p>
      <p begin="01:21.760" end="01:29.760" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:05.730" end="02:09.310" ttm:agent="v1">You think the rules don't apply to the golden boy?</p>
      <p begin="02:09.310" end="02:12.010" ttm:agent="v1">Brilliance makes up for a lot</p>
      <p begin="02:12.010" end="02:16.440" ttm:agent="v1">Don't alienate the only people in the world that understand</p>
      <p begin="02:16.440" end="02:19.860" ttm:agent="v1">You think the rules don't apply to the golden boy?</p>
      <p begin="02:19.860" end="02:22.620" ttm:agent="v1">Brilliance makes up for a lot</p>
      <p begin="02:22.620" end="02:26.820" ttm:agent="v1">Don't alienate the only people</p>
      <p begin="02:26.820" end="02:30.530" ttm:agent="v1">You think the rules don't apply to the golden boy?</p>
      <p begin="02:30.530" end="02:34.620" ttm:agent="v1">Brilliance makes up for a lot</p>
      <p begin="02:34.620" end="02:42.570" ttm:agent="v1">Don't alienate the only people in the world that understand what you do</p>
